# UNDERDELVE: foe toughness. Bat-moths, swoopers and wisps take one hit;
# grubs and axe newts two; hop toads and shellbacks three; a mimic sack ten.
# The mimic stays a chest until Mo comes near.
game underdelve
wait 10
wait 5
cheat no_gloom
cheat room 0 0 30 130
expect hp_moth == 1
cheat room 1 2 300 130
expect hp_toad == 3
cheat room 0 2 300 130
expect hp_grub == 2
cheat room 3 2 300 130
expect hp_newt == 2
expect hp_shellback == 3
cheat room 6 2 30 130
expect hp_swooper == 1
cheat room 4 5 300 130
expect hp_sack == 10
